This was down to a lapse of memory on my part, I'm afraid. I'd forgotten that 
the ZLX series graphics cards had been renamed PowerStorm, and loaded the 
subset that looked most familiar when setld presented the list of options. 
However, I should have loaded 

O3DDWSZLXE460   DWS Open3D PowerStorm 3D30 and PowerStorm 4D20 V4.6

and not

O3DDWSZLXL460   DWS Open3D ZLXp-L V4.6

With that change, all is well. Of course, if the subset names were listed as 
well as the descriptions, I don't think I would have fallen into this trap. 
That's my story, anyway.

Thanks to

Olle Eriksson <olle@cb.uu.se>

who got me on the right track (and another respondent who prefers to remain 
anonymous, despite being right ;-)

